Third-party licences for readaloud
==================================

readaloud is GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE). This file lists every Rust crate
built into the binary, grouped by licence, with each licence's text.

ONNX Runtime, which is linked in as a prebuilt library rather than a crate, is
covered by LICENSE-onnxruntime and ThirdPartyNotices-onnxruntime.txt.

